abstract: "An open, modular standard for reducing AI fabrication and improving output integrity: a prompt-layer rule framework (decision hierarchy, violation taxonomy, pre-response validation gates, drift prevention, provenance tags) paired with an honest enforcement-architecture classification of what prompt-layer controls can and cannot guarantee."
